    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Computational Neuroscience · Riverbend University</p>
            <h1 id="hero-title">Mapping how the brain <em>computes.</em></h1>
            <p class="lead">
              I build interpretable machine-learning models that connect neural activity to behavior,
              and scalable tools for making sense of complex biomedical data.
            </p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a class="btn btn--teal" href="about.html#research">Explore my research</a>
              <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="publications.html">Read publications</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta" aria-label="Research focus areas">
              <span>Neural decoding</span>
              <span>Biomedical AI</span>
              <span>Single-cell omics</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="profile-card reveal" aria-label="Profile summary">
            <div class="profile-visual">
              <span class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">LM</span>
              <div class="profile-label">
                <span>Associate Professor</span>
                <strong>Riverbend</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="profile-foot">
              <span class="status">Open to collaboration</span>
              <strong>Est. 2019</strong>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <div class="container">
          <div class="stats reveal" aria-label="Profile highlights">
            <div class="stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Selected publications</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>3</strong><span>Featured projects</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>12</strong><span>Labs using NeuroGraph</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><strong>20</strong><span>Students mentored</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-preview-title">
        <div class="container about-grid">
          <div class="reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">About Me</p>
            <h2 id="about-preview-title">From neural circuits to interpretable algorithms.</h2>
            <div class="prose">
              <p>
                I am an associate professor of Computational Neuroscience at Riverbend University's
                School of Biological Sciences. My work sits at the intersection of machine learning,
                systems neuroscience, and bioinformatics.
              </p>
              <p>
                I received my Ph.D. in Computational Biology from Baywood Institute of Technology and
                completed postdoctoral training in high-throughput imaging analysis at Northborough
                Research Center. My research asks how neural circuits encode and process complex
                sensory information — and how we can build tools that make those computations legible.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="about.html">View full profile</a>
              <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="info.md" download>Download CV</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="fact-card reveal" aria-label="Academic details">
            <h3>At a glance</h3>
            <ul class="fact-list">
              <li><strong>Position</strong><span>Associate Professor, Computational Neuroscience</span></li>
              <li><strong>Institution</strong><span>Riverbend University · School of Biological Sciences</span></li>
              <li><strong>Education</strong><span>Ph.D., Computational Biology, Baywood Institute of Technology</span></li>
              <li><strong>Location</strong><span>Blakely Hall, Room 312</span></li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--tinted" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading reveal">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Research Interests</p>
              <h2 id="research-title">Questions that connect data, circuits, and behavior.</h2>
              <p>Four interlocking lines of inquiry shape the lab's work.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="about.html#research">Research details</a>
          </div>

          <div class="card-grid">
            <article class="info-card reveal">
              <span class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <h3>Neural Encoding &amp; Decoding</h3>
              <p>Developing interpretable models that translate spike-train data into behavioral predictions.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-card reveal">
              <span class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <h3>Machine Learning for Biomedical Imaging</h3>
              <p>Applying convolutional and graph neural networks to magnetic resonance and two-photon microscopy data.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-card reveal">
              <span class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <h3>Single-Cell Omics</h3>
              <p>Designing scalable pipelines for integrating multimodal single-cell genomics and spatial transcriptomics.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-card reveal">
              <span class="card-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
              <h3>Explainable AI in Neuroscience</h3>
              <p>Building frameworks to probe decision boundaries and feature attributions in black-box models.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="featured-work-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading reveal">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Featured Work</p>
              <h2 id="featured-work-title">Methods built for real scientific questions.</h2>
              <p>Selected projects spanning imaging, connectomics, and single-cell biology.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="publications.html">All publications</a>
          </div>

          <div class="project-grid">
            <article class="project-card reveal">
              <p class="project-role">Lead Developer &amp; Project Coordinator</p>
              <h3>DeepVision</h3>
              <p>High-resolution neural activity mapping for two-photon imaging of the mouse visual cortex.</p>
              <ul class="clean-list">
                <li>PyTorch segmentation pipeline</li>
                <li>Temporal convolutional decoding</li>
                <li>Dockerized real-time service</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="project-card reveal">
              <p class="project-role">Principal Investigator</p>
              <h3>NeuroGraph</h3>
              <p>Graph neural networks for circuit analysis in electron-microscopy reconstructions.</p>
              <ul class="clean-list">
                <li>Neuron-mesh graph representations</li>
                <li>Synapse-type classification</li>
                <li>Open-source neuroinformatics toolkit</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="project-card reveal">
              <p class="project-role">Co-Principal Investigator</p>
              <h3>CellMap</h3>
              <p>A multimodal single-cell atlas of human cortical organoids.</p>
              <ul class="clean-list">
                <li>Nextflow multi-omics workflow</li>
                <li>Bayesian cell-type clustering</li>
                <li>ICSCG 2023 presentation</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--tinted" aria-labelledby="latest-posts-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading reveal">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">From the Blog</p>
