                <h3><a href="blog/interpretable-neural-models.html">Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</a></h3>
                <p>Why a model that predicts well is not enough when the goal is scientific understanding.</p>
                <a class="read-link" href="blog/interpretable-neural-models.html">Read post</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="post-card reveal">
              <div class="post-art post-art--gold" aria-hidden="true">
