                <p class="post-date"><time datetime="2025-01-01">January 2025</time></p>
                <h3><a href="blog/ml-single-cell-genomics.html">Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</a></h3>
                <p>Designing scalable, reproducible pipelines for multimodal single-cell data.</p>
                <a class="read-link" href="blog/ml-single-cell-genomics.html">Read post</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="post-card reveal">
              <div class="post-art post-art--sky" aria-hidden="true">
